      "role": "user",
      "content": "it wasnt like the fan hum though. it was too deliberate for that. it was more like... i dont even know, a syncopated beat. like triplets followed by a pause, then a rapid burst of four. it felt like a language or a handshake protocol. if i describe the spacing and the \"pitch\" of the pulses, wouldn't you be able to see if they match any known data transmission patterns or packet structures? i really think i'm catching something real here.",
